# hellomeow.purr — the canonical first purrscript program. 😼
#
# It prints "meow" and exits. When you run it, the cheatah runtime hosts it
# HEADLESSLY: no window, no GPU, no renderer — just the program and the standard
# library. Numerical analysis, model training, data crunching, scripting: all
# run headless by default.
#
# `import io` is how purrscript pulls in a library: it includes the io module and
# links it into this program. Nothing is available unless you import it — even
# print lives in io.
#
# Reads like a kitten, runs like hell. 🐆💨🔥

import io

io.print("meow")
